WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
- I hear that your mom
has a few famous admirers

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.880
which I love this.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:05.849
- [Topher] This is a true story.

00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:06.700
- And I've never seen
your mom and I'm like,

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.080
I gotta check out your mom.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.250
- My mom is a good looking woman.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.083
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:10.916
- Shout out to Pat Grace.

00:00:10.916 --> 00:00:11.749
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:14.737
- And uh, she, this happened
when I did this film

00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:16.360
"In Good Company" with Dennis Quaid.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.150
I couldn't' believe that I
was like starring in a movie

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.560
with Dennis Quaid.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.100
And she came to set with my dad.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.780
And Dennis was very nice to them.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.340
It was huge star and
they couldn't believe it.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.970
And then as he was walking
away, he was really nice.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.983
He said to me like, oh your mom's cute.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.210
And my mom overheard it.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.760
And sadly my dad overheard it too.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.080
And it was like a real bummer for them.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.823
But like she was, I mean
she really took it to heart.

00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:45.512
- [Kelly] That's so nice.

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:47.610
- And yeah, and then when
I went to the premiere

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.810
of that movie, I was waiting
in the lobby of a hotel.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:53.200
I was meeting my mom
there and she was late.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.330
She was with my dad, but she
was getting her hair done

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:57.079
'cause she was gonna see Dennis again.

00:00:57.079 --> 00:00:58.631
(laughing)

00:00:58.631 --> 00:00:59.464
And she um--

00:00:59.464 --> 00:01:01.100
- Your dad is like, I hate this guy.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:04.030
- Yeah my dad was like not
looking forward to the premiere.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:07.800
But she um, I was there in
the bar and I saw Liam Neeson

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:08.951
who's always you know, great--

00:01:08.951 --> 00:01:09.784
- Love Liam Neeson.

00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:11.100
- [Topher] Great, attractive--
- Yes.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.470
- Other big star.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:16.000
And uh, he said why are you
waiting here for your parents?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.570
And I told him this whole story.

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.820
And then I said, just get out of here,

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:19.653
you don't want to meet them.

00:01:19.653 --> 00:01:21.720
And he said, no I'd love
to meet your parents.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:25.000
So they came in and, Liam Neeson,
I've never seen him again,

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.390
but I think this is the
funniest thing ever.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.350
He goes, uh, Patricia it's
so lovely to meet you.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:31.910
Dennis Quaid told me you were cute,

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:33.292
but he didn't do you justice.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.125
(laughing)

00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:35.680
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.050
- And she like passed out.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:39.110
She couldn't believe what was going on.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:40.570
- I would've died.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.370
He's one of my favorite people ever.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:43.943
- And my dad was like, oh what the hell.

00:01:43.943 --> 00:01:45.400
- Your dad was like, are you serious?

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.722
Come on.

00:01:46.722 --> 00:01:47.555
He was like...

00:01:47.555 --> 00:01:49.412
That's amazing though,
she must've felt so good.

00:01:49.412 --> 00:01:51.610
- She worked at a private
school at the time

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.600
and I think she was back
at the school saying,

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.920
oh no, now I'm causing
this rift between...

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.783
- Dennis Quaid and Liam Neeson.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:57.967
- Dennis and Liam

00:01:57.967 --> 00:01:59.800
and like I just shouldn't
even go out there anymore.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.643
- Like, boys.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.143
I love it, I wanna meet her.

